  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training Course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NVSL-FADDL, was invited to teach a foreign animal diseases training course entitled Quarantinable Diseases, held in Piura, Peru. This course, sponsored by the SENASA branch of the Peruvian Ministry of Agriculture, provided training to Animal Quarantine workers for the government of Peru. Topics covered included FMD, Vesicular Stomatitis Virus, Swine Vesicular Disease, CSF and ASF.</narrative>
  </description>
